tool_call_format.evidence_quote:
When you need to use tools, respond with this JSON format:
{
    "server": "server-name",
    "tool": "tool-name", 
    "arguments": {"key": "value"}
}

retry_policy.evidence_quote:
The evaluation function
E :M×A×T →{0, 1}
assigns 1 if the task is successfully completed according to predefined success criteria, and 0 otherwise.
